00:06:24.770 --> 00:06:27.740
STEREN GIANNINI: So 10 minutes
ago, we announced Cloud Run--

00:06:27.740 --> 00:06:30.530
something we've been working
on for a very long time now.

00:06:30.530 --> 00:06:33.050
And we are so excited to
