00:25:17.352 --> 00:25:18.060
RYAN GREGG: Yeah.

00:25:18.060 --> 00:25:20.625
And you thanked the thousands
of alpha testers that we had,

00:25:20.625 --> 00:25:23.000
which we really could not have
