00:26:59.805 --> 00:27:02.240
And so that means literally,
you can run anything,

00:27:02.240 --> 00:27:05.800
including as soft of a
binary of a video game

00:27:05.800 --> 00:27:06.980
in a serverless way.

00:27:06.980 --> 00:27:07.660
RYAN GREGG: It was
