00:27:11.912 --> 00:27:14.840
so it's like 80 people playing
the game simultaneously.

00:27:14.840 --> 00:27:16.030
MARK MIRCHANDANI: And it
just scales right up for it.

00:27:16.030 --> 00:27:17.110
RYAN GREGG: And it just
scales right up, yeah.

00:27:17.110 --> 00:27:18.860
STEREN GIANNINI: So
to be clear, Cloud Run

00:27:18.860 --> 00:27:20.650
is not a replacement
