00:27:23.330 --> 00:27:23.510
RYAN GREGG: That's right, yeah.

00:27:23.510 --> 00:27:24.800
STEREN GIANNINI: It's not
a video game platform.

00:27:24.800 --> 00:27:27.010
MARK MIRCHANDANI: It can handle
